; ==============================================================================
;  config\menus\apps-startmenu.rc  -  shared by the themes; no look here (icons come from variables
;  each theme defines: IconExplorer, IconTerminal, IconTaskManager; empty = no icon).
;  Programs every theme offers at the top of its menus. Variant for *PopupStartMenu; menus\apps.rc has the same entries for *Popup.
;  Owned by the repo: deploy and the installer overwrite it. Menus cannot be extended
;  from personal.rc (it is read before the theme; see AGENTS.md section 5).
; ==============================================================================
*PopupStartMenu .icon="$IconExplorer$" "$TxtExplorer$" !Execute [explorer.exe]
*PopupStartMenu .icon="$IconTerminal$" "$TxtTerminal$" !Execute [wt.exe]
*PopupStartMenu .icon="$IconTaskManager$" "$TxtTaskManager$" !Execute [taskmgr.exe]
